I reviewed PR 181 (`pi-exa-guided/qualification` → `pi-exa-guided/recovery`, head `d7d7d07`). The two highest-ranked findings are real bugs in `extensions/index.ts`. In Pi 1.1.0 (`loader.js` / `agent-session-services.js`), flag values only exist after extension factories run. The `session_start` refresh only registers tools that weren't registered yet, so anything decided at factory time, before flags exist, stays in place. Lower-ranked items cover test sync and fixture problems.

